target
# Harvested by pittv3-lib's ocsp_unknown_serial probe; kept out of the tree until something is
# promoted to a fixture, but not under target/, which is disposable.
ocsp-probe/
certval/tests/examples/rfc822_dn_nc/generate.py
pittv3-wasm/dist/

# Written by pittv3-wasm/build.rs from the certval_stores_* providers the lock
# pins, and republished into dist/ by Trunk on every build. Named one by one
# rather than as resources/*.cbor so that a store added to build.rs has to be
# added here too, and so a file dropped into resources/ by hand is still seen.
# The certificates they carry are versioned in the provider repositories; what
# this repository keeps is pittv3-wasm/stores.manifest.
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_eca_ca.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_eca_ta.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_nipr_cceb_interop_ca.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_nipr_cceb_interop_ta.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_nipr_interop_ca.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_nipr_interop_ta.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_nipr_om_ca.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_nipr_om_ta.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_nipr_prod_ca.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_nipr_prod_ta.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_wcf_ca.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/dod_wcf_ta.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/webpki_ca.cbor
pittv3-wasm/resources/webpki_ta.cbor
